  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.1:\n  - PF-008: Extended SmsTenantConfig record with TemplateIds (IReadOnlyDictionary<string, string>?) for per-notification-type DLT template ID lookup.\n\n  v2.2.0:\n  - PF-001: Added EntityId and DefaultTemplateId to AwsSnsOptions for India A2P / DLT compliance.\n  - PF-001: AwsSnsSmsSender now injects AWS.MM.SMS.EntityId and AWS.MM.SMS.TemplateId message attributes.\n  - PF-002: Added SmsDispatchOptions for per-message DLT template ID and sender ID overrides.\n  - PF-002: ISmsSender now has a default SendAsync(to, message, SmsDispatchOptions?, ct) overload.\n  - PF-003: Added ISmsTenantConfigResolver interface and SmsTenantConfig record.\n  - PF-003: Added UseSmsTenantConfigResolver<T>() DI extension for per-tenant SMS config resolution.\n  - PF-004: Added PostgresNotificationPreferenceStore backed by Npgsql for production opt-out storage.\n  - PF-004: Added UsePostgresPreferenceStore() DI extension (Action and IConfiguration overloads).\n\n  v2.1.0:\n  - Added AWS SQS queue backend via UseAwsSqsQueue() and AwsSqsNotificationQueue.\n  - Added per-tenant email routing via UsePerTenantEmail() tenant sender resolution.\n  - Added notification preference/opt-out pipeline via INotificationPreferenceStore and in-memory default.\n\n  v2.0.0:\n  - Standardized Framework Release.\n  - Renamed all packages to PrimusSaaS.* namespace.\n  - Synchronized versions across the entire suite.\n  - Enhanced metadata and fixed consistency issues.",
